Description: CVE-2026-107818 - environment injection via wsrep bootstrap in the service file
 MDEV-40629. The mariadb.service unit read its EnvironmentFile
 (wsrep-new-cluster, wsrep-start-position) from a directory writable by
 the mariadbd user, so the server (e.g. via SELECT ... INTO OUTFILE) could
 inject arbitrary environment variables into the service.
 .
 Move the wsrep-new-cluster environment file to /run (INSTALL_RUNDIR), which
 mariadbd cannot write to, let galera_new_cluster remove it, and drop the
 wsrep-start-position file by running galera_recovery inline in ExecStart.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/e3d62d4e78fd4941cef3f5053e6a50d0b32d740e
Author: Sergei Golubchik <serg@mariadb.org>
Last-Update: 2026-10-11
