Description: CVE-2026-107823 - MDEV-40484 ambiguous view frm parsing when username includes newline
 The view definer_user and definer_host were written to the view .frm file
 unescaped (FILE_OPTIONS_STRING). A user name containing newlines, e.g.
 "root\ndefiner_host=localhost\nsuid=1", could inject extra key=value lines
 into the .frm and alter the definer/suid of the view. Write and parse both
 fields as FILE_OPTIONS_ESTRING (escaped). The parse_file.h hunk of the
 upstream fix is omitted: FILE_OPTIONS_STRING is still used by other fields.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/8a642bc8103aadc6b2087d781ba8e1595616a2c4
Author: Sergei Golubchik <serg@mariadb.org>
