Description: CVE-2026-85746 - Fix buffer overflow in Geometry::as_wkt() on nested geometry collections
 Geometry::as_wkt() did not account for bytes written into the result string
 by the recursive call to get_data_as_wkt(), and
 Gis_geometry_collection::get_data_as_wkt() never reserved space. Nested
 geometry collections could therefore overflow the buffer through
 String::qs_append(). Switch the affected calls to the checked append().
 (MDEV-40329)
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/5c04ca5524385356ff7cf84974a7d491974c1f85
