Description: CVE-2026-107815 - CONNECT crashes on double(255,50) in DOS table
 TYPVAL<double>::SetValue_char() copied at most 31 bytes into a 64 byte
 stack buffer but then used the uncapped length n to place the terminating
 NUL, writing out of bounds for longer values. Cap n itself so that the
 terminator is written at the correct position (MDEV-40637).
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/b369925f6855d3e1f0ebcf453492724b99fda6f8
